*.log

# 开发机上的临时探针脚本：只在本机调试 UI 用，不进公开仓库
/scripts/*-probe.ps1
/scripts/probe-*.ps1
/scripts/listwin.ps1
/scripts/menu*.ps1
/scripts/midclick-*.ps1

